silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_07_mittens_storage_packet_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The 07_mittens_storage_packetSourceNode is The typed source federation object for 07_mittens_storage_packet. In the Mittens example: VetRecord_Mittens, StoragePacket_Mittens, or KGAssertion_Mittens depending on the operation path. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source (typed federation object)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
